lation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c10\", \"kind\": \"CLAIM_HISTORY\", \"text\": \"The earlier audit-export approval records a two-row transfer failure without an established production submission failure or lost rating; its follow-up records a repair verified in the checked rows, not a fix for the current submission reports.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:safety-audit-export-escape-approval@1.0:ef16b307\", \"k:safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0:e8cca237\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c11\", \"kind\": \"CLAIM_SOURCE_FACT\", \"text\": \"The team lead's October 2 batch announcement asks for affected task references in its thread and says no policy change has been announced; it does not designate an engineering intake route.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:slack:C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790938147.000085:0b9bb16c\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U006\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790938147.000085:0b9bb16c\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c12\", \"kind\": \"CLAIM_INFERENCE\", \"text\": \"The supplied threads contain no confirmed recovery or completed submission, no response supplying the requested error state and time for SAFETY-1992, and no answer to the required-field question in the SAFETY-7534 thread.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917625.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"summary:s1\", \"kind\": \"SUMMARY\", \"text\": \"A QA tutor and four tutors report LT submission problems, including disabled Submit controls, a task that will not submit, a label reset and missing confirmation.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U002\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U020\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U015\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U012\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"summary:s2\", \"kind\": \"SUMMARY\", \"text\": \"The threads show no confirmed recovery; an engineer has requested diagnostic details for SAFETY-1992.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917625.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U005\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"role\": \"ENGINEER\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U002\", \"relation\": \"THREAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d1\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"A QA tutor reports disabled Submit after selecting a safety category on SAFETY-1992; a tutor reports disabled Submit despite completing every rubric field.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U002\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U020\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U005\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"role\": \"ENGINEER\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U002\", \"relation\": \"THREAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d2\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"A tutor reports that a task will not submit after selecting the quarantine decision.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d3\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"A tutor reports a label reset when finalizing SAFETY-7534; a tutor in that thread reports no submitted confirmation after selecting B.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U015\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U012\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d4\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"An engineer requested the error state and time for SAFETY-1992; a QA tutor in the SAFETY-7534 thread asked about required fields and the submit control, but the threads contain no answers to those requests.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917625.000226\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U005\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"role\": \"ENGINEER\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U002\", \"relation\": \"THREAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U019\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917625.000226\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d5\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The team lead instructed the SAFETY-1992 thread to retain the task reference, flag the failure and not count the task complete without confirmation, including after a successful reload.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U006\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d6\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The earlier audit-export records concern a two-row transfer repair, not a demonstrated fix for these LT submission reports.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:safety-audit-export-escape-approval@1.0:ef16b307\", \"k:safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0:e8cca237\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action\", \"kind\": \"ACTION\", \"text\": \"Report a technical issue to engineering. Instruction: Report the LT submission failures to engineering, grouping the reported symptoms and preserving each task reference and outstanding diagnostic request. Draft to copy: Please investigate these LT submission reports:\\n- A QA tutor reports disabled Submit after selecting a category on SAFETY-1992; a tutor reports disabled Submit despite completing every rubric field.\\n- A tutor reports that a task will not submit after selecting quarantine.\\n- A tutor reports a label reset when finalizing SAFETY-7534; a tutor in that thread reports no submitted confirmation after selecting B.\\n\\nPlease assess these symptoms without assuming a shared cause. For affected reports, please provide task IDs, field states and errors. For SAFETY-1992, please also provide the time requested by an engineer. For SAFETY-7534, please answer the QA tutor's field/control question and provide the exact step after choosing the rating. Scope: This is a technical assessment request, not a confirmed diagnosis or a change to safety classification rules; category selection alone does not confirm submission.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917625.000226\", \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:4a0a4f89\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\"], \"premises\": [{\"statement_id\": \"claim:c1\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c2\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c3\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c4\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c5\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c6\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c7\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c8\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c12\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:rationale\", \"kind\": \"ACTION_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Why this helps: The reported submission and label-state failures need technical assessment, and an engineer has already requested diagnostics for one affected task. Current instructions specify the information to capture without treating label selection as submission confirmation.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872039.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917625.000226\", \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:4a0a4f89\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790872090.000226\", \"k:safety-audit-export-escape-approval@1.0:ef16b307\", \"k:safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0:e8cca237\", \"k:slack:C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790938147.000085:0b9bb16c\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:need\", \"kind\": \"INTERVENTION_NEED\", \"text\": \"Why intervening now is needed (an operational problem that needs coordination): A QA tutor and four tutors report submission-related failures without confirmed recovery in their threads, warranting engineering assessment now.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871992.000084\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915882.000086\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790915927.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917534.000087\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790917589.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"announcement:k:slack:C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790938147.000085:0b9bb16c\", \"kind\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT_HANDLING\", \"text\": \"This announcement applies to this topic and directs current handling: \\\"Add affected task references here; no policy change has been announced.\\\". The announcement concerns the same batch and labeled-task submission problem. Its directive governs collecting affected references in its thread, not escalation or an engineering route.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:slack:C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790938147.000085:0b9bb16c\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_dcb54d926a1edb28165101ad\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_dcb54d926a1edb28165101ad is P