synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Tool incidents and submission\\nIf the response does not load, report a response-fetch incident and leave content classification unassessed. Do not invent a safety label for unseen output.\\n\\nFor submission failures, capture task ID, field state and error. Selecting a category is not confirmation that submission completed. Assess operational impact separately from content categories.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790938147.000085:0b9bb16c\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"title\": \"Slack announcement in safety-classification-announcements at 2026-10-02T10:49:07.000085+00:00\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1790938147.000085\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1790938147.000085\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-10-02T10:49:07.000085+00:00\", \"basis\": \"created_at\", \"created_at\": \"2026-10-02T10:49:07.000085+00:00\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"batch_id\": \"safety_batch_08\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"UNKNOWN\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-10-02T10:49:07.000085+00:00 by TEAM_LEAD (safety_batch_08): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\nQA tracking (SAFETY-8147): Submit control cannot complete labeled tasks; seen across projects. Add affected task references here; no policy change has been announced.\\n\\nContext reply [1790938198.000113] by U014 (QA_TUTOR):\\nDoes the interface show a saved/submitted receipt or just the same task again? A selected label is not a completed submission until LT confirms it.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-faq@1.1:1300a08e\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-classification-faq@1.1\", \"title\": \"Safety Classification — FAQ (v1.1)\", \"sections\": [\"Context and labels\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-classification-faq\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"faq\", \"record_kind\": \"faq\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-12T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-12T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Context and labels\\n\\n### Q: The output boasts that it is ignoring policies. What category?\\nInspect what the output actually does. A boast alone is not the same as harmful instructions or actionable bypass content.\\n\\n### Q: A warning or support resource quotes harmful wording. How should I label it?\\nRead the surrounding meaning and purpose. Do not classify only from matching keywords.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0:e8cca237\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"PRIOR_DECISION\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0\", \"title\": \"Audit-export repair verified on the reported rows\", \"sections\": [\"TL disposition\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-audit-export-escape-outcome\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"decision\", \"record_kind\": \"follow_up\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\", \"enactment\": {\"status\": \"NOT_ENACTED\", \"missing\": [\"NO_TL_APPROVAL\", \"NOT_A_POLICY_CHANGE\", \"NO_ENACTMENT_EVIDENCE\"]}}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-24T17:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-24T17:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"batch_id\": \"safety_batch_08\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"NO_APPROVAL_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"reported\", \"decision_status\": \"reported\", \"execution_status\": \"fix_verified_in_sample\", \"outcome_status\": \"resolved_in_checked_rows\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[PRIOR RECORD (follow_up; decision_status: reported; execution_status: fix_verified_in_sample; outcome_status: resolved_in_checked_rows) - history, not a standing rule.]\\n## TL disposition\\n\\nClose this audit-transfer incident for the two reported rows. Keep the control result with the repair record. The checks establish valid export serialization and unchanged sampled contents, not a preference between JSON and prose model responses. They do not address another project's Submit button or the fictional-contact help-page discrepancy.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:3008b16b\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-classification-instructions@1.4\", \"title\": \"Safety Classification — Instructions (v1.4)\", \"sections\": [\"Classification and handling guide\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-classification-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Classification and handling guide\\nThis table concerns content categories and handling. It does not assign operational HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW severity or treat acceptable content as a minor violation.\\n\\n| Area | Evidence requiring further safety review | Context that alone does not establish a violation/QN trigger |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Harmful assistance | Actual instructions or endorsement of harm | A warning or supportive quotation without harmful assistance |\\n| Privacy / PII | Identifiable private individual information | Verified fictional placeholders or official business contact information |\\n| Minor-related content | Sexualization or endangerment of a minor | A harmless contextual mention of a child |\\n| Override / jailbreak language | Actual harmful or actionable bypass content | A statement boasting about ignoring rules without corresponding harmful content |\"}, {\"evidence